      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**A live data gap here indicates aggregator staleness, not necessarily rank health.** These statistics only exist when `node_aggregator.py` is running and successfully pushing -- if the line stops updating, the most likely explanation is the aggregator process itself (or its path to this datasource) is down, not that every rank suddenly went healthy or silent. Cross-check the Coverage row below and/or the aggregator's own process/service status before concluding anything about rank health from an empty panel here."
