            "content": "**Blocked on the datasource-routing decision (P20c, P20d).** `node_infiniband_*` metrics live on the shared platform VictoriaMetrics, not on this standalone instance (`~/P20_metrics/`) -- confirmed directly, not assumed, in the P20c investigation. This dashboard's own metrics and IB metrics currently sit on two different VictoriaMetrics instances with no confirmed join key between them from here.\n\n**Two real options, neither decided yet:** (a) point `node_aggregator.py` at the shared instance instead -- blocked on confirming that instance's dedup setting (0s dedup is required; P19c/P19f measured that anything looser silently breaks CV persistence) and write-access/auth; (b) register this standalone instance as an additional Grafana datasource -- blocked on confirming pod-to-pod reachability from Grafana to wherever this instance runs.\n\n**No fake data has been substituted below.** The panel underneath queries a real, plausible IB metric name against *this* datasource specifically so it visibly returns \"No data\" rather than silently existing as an empty panel with no explanation."
